      "mergeID": "61a400092e174c3ba95057b5",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Same bug from previous live build is still present in the latest Beta build \"1154\". \nUpon loading media files (.M3U8 / .MKV) it can randomly crash the entire VRChat game.\nVRChat logs always end on the same line\n\"[AVProVideo] Texture size changed:\"\nIssue affects every world that uses AVPro.\nCanny ticket from live build with almost 300 Upvotes; https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/1149-avpro-will-randomly-crash-game-on-streamed-content\nIssue was not present in previous builds of AVPro, Only with AVPro 2.2.1",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1154] AVPro will randomly crash game",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "618c4dde9c49161a8bdc8dd8",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is most likely related to AVPro and not VRChat, so probably not much they can do about it other than maybe updating it? Idk. \nBtw issues that are the same as on live normally don't belong in to the Open Beta category. ^^",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
