      "mergedPostDetails": "When loading some videos on Beta, I'm instantly crashed out of VRChat. Those same videos load and play successfully without issue on Live.\nSpecific steps to reproduce:\nLoading Dune (2021) in Doxis' MOVIE & CHILL world.\nLinks to logs below. Not sure which shows the crash. Thinking it's the larger file size one.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Np_MHGeqM7cd2knJYTEvK32f7s712jll?usp=sharing\n\nEdit: I tried launching on the Beta again to try to reproduce this crash with another video with the same player in the same instance, but I was now unable to reproduce it. I tried it again with the same video and was still unable to reproduce it. It's strange that it was so consistent before, but I'm unable to figure out what may have changed in order for my issue to be resolved.\n\nHere's hoping it isn't something that randomly occurs once it reaches live.",
