  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The 1149 build now has AVPro 2.2.1. and appears to give large lag spikes and sometimes straight out crashes the users randomly.\nThis was replicated many times with .m3u8 streams. However, Twitch streams and m3u links also seem to cause huge lag spikes on play. \nRecreating this is somewhat difficult, as it is random. But this is occurring across many other users.\nThese are the worlds where we were able to recreate the crashes.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_985acb34-cc17-4b5a-85ae-04ade5195059\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_791ebf58-54ce-4d3a-a0a0-39f10e1b20b2\nThis issue occurs only on AVPro. Not Unity video player component.",
